(6816146, 1024524, 143098, '<td valign="top">I like this one it tells a nice story, and is also has a pleasing cast to the colors you really feel the mist over the lake a nice photo indeed one of my top 3 for this challenge. One question kept bothering me...How did a person in a wheel chair get the kayak to the water? have this funny image inn my head of a guy with a kayak on his head like a hat wheeling his chair down a dirt path through the woods. Sorry had to share.</td>', 'I like this one it tells a nice story, and is also has a pleasing cast to the colors you really feel the mist over the lake a nice photo indeed one of my top 3 for this challenge. One question kept bothering me...How did a person in a wheel chair get the kayak to the water? have this funny image inn my head of a guy with a kayak on his head like a hat wheeling his chair down a dirt path through the woods. Sorry had to share.', '2012-07-12 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
