(6816290, 1024532, 10785, '<td valign="top">She looks like the Reluctant Volunteer!! lol! Lovely color here and very good exposure on the subject that counts! The backlighting really does overwhelm the image. I am assuming you used a flash pop for fill. Unfortunately the shutter speed at 1/200 or less probably let in too much of the ambient light.</td>', 'She looks like the Reluctant Volunteer!! lol! Lovely color here and very good exposure on the subject that counts! The backlighting really does overwhelm the image. I am assuming you used a flash pop for fill. Unfortunately the shutter speed at 1/200 or less probably let in too much of the ambient light.', '2012-07-12 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
