(6816779, 1023906, 120902, '<td valign="top">I am just elated..... this is my first ribbon. <br/> <br/>This photo was taken during our local summerfest / Canada day celebrations. I had set up my camera on the ground to take multiple shots of the fireworks. The couple nearby just happened to sit still long enough for a sharp capture. This was the only shot out of a dozen or so that was useable.<br/> <br/>Postprocessing was mostly done with lightroom:<br/>Adjusted highlights and shadows, contrast, and did some local white balance adjustments on couple due to overhead sodium lights, noise reduction and saturation adjustments. added vignetting<br/> <br/>Thanks to all who voted and for the encouraging comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-07-13 00:44:18.</i></td>', 'I am just elated..... this is my first ribbon.  This photo was taken during our local summerfest / Canada day celebrations. I had set up my camera on the ground to take multiple shots of the fireworks. The couple nearby just happened to sit still long enough for a sharp capture. This was the only shot out of a dozen or so that was useable. Postprocessing was mostly done with lightroom:Adjusted highlights and shadows, contrast, and did some local white balance adjustments on couple due to overhead sodium lights, noise reduction and saturation adjustments. added vignetting Thanks to all who voted and for the encouraging comments.', '2012-07-13 01:43:13.000000', '2012-07-13 01:44:18.000000', 0),
